{"study_accession":"PRJNA822846","secondary_study_accession":"SRP367368","title":"Immune challenged SC-islets first response profiled by single cell transcription analysis after co-culture with human allogeneic PBMCs [scRNA-seq_invitro]","description":"We performed an in vitro co-culture of allogeneic PBMCs and SC-islet clusters. SC-islet clusters were enriched for β cells (using CD49A magnetic sorting; SC-α still remain at lower numbers) (Veres et al., 2019), dissociated and reaggregated to obtain a more uniform cell count between wells. SC-islets were co-cultured with human allogeneic PBMCs for 24 or 48 hours. As controls [time(t)=0], SC-islets remained in culture without PBMC addition. These samples, in addition to PBMCs alone (t=0), were used for scRNA-seq (Figure 2A). Overall design: Comparing expression datasets from PBMC co-cultured with SC-islets, to SC-islets alone","pubmed":"36055241","geo_series":"","n_samples":8,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN27280067","study_accession":"PRJNA822846","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"sBWH7 [re-used]","description":"sBWH7 [re-used]","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM6008412","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":2,"first_public":"2022-09-03","attributes":[["source_name","PBMC"],["cell source","Peripheral Blood Mononuclear Cell"],["considered_timepoint","0"],["sample_type","PBMC"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR18591142","experiment_accession":"SRX14719806","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2000","read_count":715708615,"base_count":85169325185,"first_public":"2022-09-03","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2000 sequencing: GSM6008412: sBWH7 [re-used] Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"},{"run_accession":"SRR18591143","experiment_accession":"SRX14719806","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2000","read_count":717891573,"base_count":85429097187,"first_public":"2022-09-03","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2000 sequencing: G